{"id":"c5ab86dd38fd2810","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-logarithmic-space-classes.md","title":"L、NL 与 coNL","display":"df-logarithmic-space-classes — L、NL 与 coNL","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes","aliases":["73-df-logarithmic-space-classes"],"display":"df-logarithmic-space-classes — L、NL 与 coNL","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.5, pp. 347–349; scans 355–357","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-logarithmic-space-classes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-logarithmic-space-classes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logarithmic-space-classes — L、NL 与 coNL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.5, pp. 347–349; scans 355–357"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>工作空间类与只读有界输入读头约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，语言载体均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\)</span> 表示文献通常记作 L 的确定性对数空间类，和图灵机的左移标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathsf L\\)</span> 区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(\\ell),\\qquad\\mathsf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{NSPACE}(\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(\\ell),\\qquad\\mathsf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{NSPACE}(\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus A\\in\\mathsf{NL}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus A\\in\\mathsf{NL}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入本身不计入工作空间；空间类采用渐近常数，所以 n+2 的正值修正不改变通常的对数空间类。不要求此处精确的 ℓ 本身满足旧接口的全长度精确可构造性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"工作空间类与只读有界输入读头约定见 [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]、[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$，语言载体均为 $\\mathbf2^*$。$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}$ 表示文献通常记作 L 的确定性对数空间类，和图灵机的左移标签 $\\mathsf L$ 区分。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"工作空间类与只读有界输入读头约定见 [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]、[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$，语言载体均为 $\\mathbf2^*$。$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}$ 表示文献通常记作 L 的确定性对数空间类，和图灵机的左移标签 $\\mathsf L$ 区分。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil,\\qquad\\mathsf{LOGSPACE}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(\\ell),\\qquad\\mathsf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{NSPACE}(\\ell)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithmic\\text{-}space\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus A\\in\\mathsf{NL}\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1866,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes|L、NL 与 coNL]]"},{"id":"d2364757335c3ba6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}$ 见 [[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]，$\\mathsf P$ 见 [[73-df-binary-p]]。输入读头必须遵守其工作空间模型的有界约定。"}],"outgoing":["1a769cdc24b3e236","5487b1bca12f6c5f"]}